      "paragraphs": [
        "Options for SceneDirector.change (definition §6.3). Carries the activation `data` (when `Data` is not `void`), `suspendCurrent`, and an optional `transition` — a class-based `SceneTransition`/ `PhasedSceneTransition`, or an `{ enter, exit }` pair — resolved against the target's registry-level default (spec §3.10) to drive the switch through a SceneTransitionSession; see SceneDirector.change's doc comment for the full guarantee."
